[0.000, "o", "=== 1. Ledger killed mid-transfer (SPEC 9.3, NFR-AVAIL-2/4)\r\n    inject: kill ledger-service for 20 s under 20 RPS.  expect: 503 + Retry-After, never 500; no partial transaction\r\n"]
