[0.000, "o", "\r\n=== 3. Projection killed (SPEC 9.6, NFR-AVAIL-3)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    inject: kill projection-service for ~30 s under 20 RPS.  expect: balances go stale; afterwards lag 0 and projection matches the ledger\r\n"]
