[0.000, "o", "\r\n=== 4. Wallet killed mid-transfer (SPEC 9.1/9.2, 1.1 #5)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    inject: a burst of transfers with fixed Idempotency-Keys, kill wallet-service mid-burst, restart, replay every key\r\n    expect: every key ends as one 201; exactly one ledger transaction (two entries) per key; none doubled\r\n"]
